    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Lake desiccation drives carbon and nitrogen biogeochemistry of a sub-tropical hypersaline lake","description":"Saline lakes across the globe have experienced severe reduction in their surface area as a result of climate change and human-induced perturbations like water diversion and extraction. The changing lake volume is predicted to have large-scale implication on the in-lake biogeochemistry. This study explores the carbon (C) and nitrogen (N) cycling in a desiccating hypersaline lake (Sambhar Lake, India) along with adjacently located brine reservoir and salt pans by measuring concentrations and stable isotopic ratios of different C and N pools during winter and monsoon. Incubation experiments to estimate the net nitrification and mineralization rates in lake sediments were also performed. The Lake witnessed a large decrease in surface area and showed a clear signature of desiccation on lake biogeochemistry. Both particulate and dissolved fractions of C and N in the lake increased as the lake desiccated from monsoon to winter. Low N isotopic composition (δ15N) of particulate organic matter during winter suggested the presence of N2 fixers in this nutrient-rich saline environment. Taken together, significant difference in C and N concentrations and isotopic compositions were observed across the lake, brine reservoir, and salt pans, suggesting considerable modulation of in-lake processes due to human interventions.","datePublished":"2023-04-05T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2023-04-05T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"4557","pageEnd":"4574","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10750-023-05193-8","keywords":["Saline lake","Biogeochemistry","Stable isotopes","Particulate organic matter","Dissolved inorganic carbon","Freshwater & Marine Ecology","Ecology","Zoology"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig1_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig2_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig3_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig4_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig5_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig6_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs10750-023-05193-8/MediaObjects/10750_2023_5193_Fig7_HTML.png"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Hydrobiologia","issn":["1573-5117","0018-8158"],"volumeNumber":"850","@type":["Periodical","PublicationVolume"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer International Publishing","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Siddhartha Sarkar","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Indian Institute of Technology","address":{"name":"Department of Earth Sciences, Indian Institute of Technology, Gandhinagar, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Mohammad Atif Khan","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Gujarat University","address":{"name":"Department of Earth Sciences, Gujarat University, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Niharika Sharma","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Abdur Rahman","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Ravi Bhushan","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"A. K. Sudheer","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Sanjeev Kumar","affiliation":[{"name":"Physical Research Laboratory","address":{"name":"Geosciences Division, Physical Research Laboratory, Ahmedabad, India","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"sanjeev@prl.res.in","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
